1. Work performed

Patched the fused direct decode path in [expert_layer.cpp](/home/khkramer/src/nemotron-inference/runtime/src/backend/expert_layer.cpp#L1478) so `impl_->monolithic_resident` now bypasses the routed-expert upload loop and passes the prebuilt monolithic device view arrays directly to `RunFusedMoeDirectDecode`. In that branch, `total_staging_calls` and the new `monolithic_layers` counter are incremented, while uploaded bytes and staging time remain zero. The non-monolithic resident and staged fallback paths are unchanged.

