No compile-time concerns. The normal monolithic path now avoids per-token expert weight uploads and timing; the only remaining per-call device copies in this area are the existing optional selected-index debug buffers if `NEMOTRON_FORWARD_FUSED_MOE_HOST_SELECTION` is enabled.

